(7530563, 1204152, 104230, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> Hope you''re ok too... You''re socks are... hmmm very errr... nice... "fingers crossed behind back" </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No, not his usual sartorial choice!!<br/> <br/>He was given the socks in the ER. I was amused by them too, until after he was admitted and the nurse (nearly) wouldn''t let him walk to the bathroom five feet away from his bed because the yellow socks indicated he was a "fall risk".  Then I realized this was part of a rather clever system!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-08-23 15:46:53.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by IreneM: Hope you''re ok too... You''re socks are... hmmm very errr... nice... "fingers crossed behind back"   No, not his usual sartorial choice!! He was given the socks in the ER. I was amused by them too, until after he was admitted and the nurse (nearly) wouldn''t let him walk to the bathroom five feet away from his bed because the yellow socks indicated he was a "fall risk".  Then I realized this was part of a rather clever system!', '2017-08-23 14:20:59.000000', '2017-08-23 16:46:53.000000', 0),
